++## Negative controls
++
++`tools/nc_e9.py` — 6 мутаций named messages: `bad-forged-header`,
++`bad-quorum`, `bad-chain`, **`bad-finalized` (гейтовая — «OS client
++checks finalized checkpoint»)**, `bad-replay`, `bad-pause`.
